  unitName: Bolt Pike Amy
  unitId: 40212
  unitNumber: 296
  description: The eldest daughter of an aristocratic family from Palmyna, she had
    a very strong sense of justice, and whenever anything happened within the domain
    she would race to the scene with her beloved halberd to solve the issue herself.
    Her parents thought this dangerous and tried to stop her, but her fair judgment
    received strong public support which forced them to approve. She mercilessly
    cut down criminals with what they revered to as her "Bolt Pike of Judgment."
  summonDesc: Did you summon me?<br>If so, then let us bring justice<br>to where
    it is needed!
  fusionDesc: I will become stronger!<br>Leave everything to me!
